{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>עיפתה</b> — darkness, and like it: יעשה שחר עיפה (He makes dawn darkness)." "<b>סדרים</b> — they are the arrays of the stars. And the Targum: יערוך יסדר (He arranges, He orders)."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:02:20.475473888Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}